# scripts/

Bash helpers for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

| Script | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `check-file-size.sh` | Warns on `*.kt` files over the 500-line soft cap. Invoked by the Gradle `checkFileSize` task (which runs after `ktlintCheck`). Warning-only by design — never fails. |

Run directly:

```sh
bash scripts/check-file-size.sh
```

